<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex upped to l-t buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex upped to l-t buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- HSBC James Capel analyst Paul Aran raised Mexican phone giant Telefonos de Mexico (Telmex) to long-term buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe the company has done an excellent job in preparing for competition, having spent most of the 1990s lowering its cost structure and improving quality service.</p>
<p>-- Said price/earnings per ADR estimated at multiples of 10.9x and 8.3x for 1997 and 1998 were attractive.</p>
<p>-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560</p>
</text>
